    "html": "<p>This Cookie Policy explains how Hasamex Pte. Ltd. (“Hasamex,” “we,” “our,” or “us”) uses cookies and similar technologies on our website. It is part of our broader commitment to transparency and user trust, and should be read alongside our <a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy Policy</a>.</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">What Are Cookies?</h2><p>Cookies are small data files placed on your device when you visit a website. They help us remember your preferences, improve your browsing experience, and understand how you interact with our content. Similar technologies—such as pixels, tags, and local storage—may also be used to deliver, measure, and enhance our services.</p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">Why We Use Cookies</h2><p>At Hasamex, cookies serve several purposes:</p><p><strong>Functionality:</strong> To remember settings like language preferences or login states</p><p><strong>Security:</strong> To protect access to secure areas and prevent misuse</p><p><strong>Analytics:</strong> To understand how visitors navigate our site and improve performance</p><p><strong>Communication:</strong> To help us tailor relevant updates or offers (only with your consent). We do not use cookies to collect sensitive personal information without your explicit permission. And we never sell your data to third parties.</p><h2 id=\"sec-3\">Types of Cookies We Use</h2><p><strong>Essential Cookies: </strong>Required for the website to work properly. These enable secure login, form submission, and access control. Without them, certain features won’t function as expected.</p><p><strong>Performance &amp; Analytics Cookies: </strong>Help us understand site usage—like which pages are most visited or where users drop off—so we can improve design, speed, and content flow.</p><p><strong>Functionality Cookies: </strong>Allow the site to remember your preferences—such as display settings, location, or whether you’ve dismissed a banner—so your experience is more consistent.</p><p><strong>Marketing Cookies</strong> <em>(only with consent): </em>Used to deliver more relevant communications or measure the effectiveness of campaigns. These are mostly placed by trusted third-party providers and never without opt-in consent.</p><h2 id=\"sec-4\">Cookie Duration &amp; Source</h2><p><strong>Session-based</strong> – active only during your visit and removed once you close your browser</p><p><strong>Persistent</strong> – stored for a defined period to retain preferences or track return visits</p><p><strong>First-party</strong> – set directly by Hasamex</p><p><strong>Third-party</strong> – placed by trusted services (e.g., analytics or video hosting platforms)</p><h2 id=\"sec-5\">Your Choices &amp; Control</h2><p>You are in control. When you visit our site, you may be prompted to manage cookie preferences. You can also adjust your browser settings to block or delete cookies at any time. Please note: disabling certain cookies may affect your experience on the site.</p><p>Essential cookies cannot be disabled as they are necessary for site operation.</p><h2 id=\"sec-6\">Contact Us</h2><p>For questions about how Hasamex uses cookies or handles your data:</p><p><a href=\"mailto:privacy@hasamex.com\">privacy@hasamex.com</a></p><h2 id=\"sec-7\">Hasamex Pte. Ltd.</h2><p>160 Robinson Road, #14-04</p><p>Singapore Business Federation Center</p><p><mark class=\"flag\" title=\"Postal code appears truncated on the current site (068914 elsewhere) – needs confirmation\">Singapore 06891</mark></p>"
